Short:        Short script to compile sas c from CED.
Author:       anthony@backyard.demon.co.uk
Uploader:     anthony backyard demon co uk
Type:         dev/c
Version:      1.0
Architecture: m68k-amigaos
Distibution:  FreeWare

This script can be put into CED's dos-arexx function keys to enable SAS'C to
compile the file loaded after prompting to auto-save first in case you write
unstable 'C' code like me :-)
